🎓 Student Registration Portal

A simple and responsive Student Registration Form built using HTML5 and CSS3.
This project is suitable for beginners learning frontend web development and form design.

📌 Project Description

The Student Registration Portal allows users to enter basic student details such as name, email, department, and gender through a clean and user-friendly interface.

It demonstrates:

Semantic HTML structure

External CSS styling

Form elements and layout design

Basic UI/UX principles

🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5

CSS3

✨ Features

Clean and modern UI

Header, navigation bar, main content, and footer

Student registration form with:

Full Name

Email

Department selection

Gender selection

Hover effects for buttons and inputs

Responsive centered form layout
